From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:34:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 068/342] meson_hdmi: sleep again when the vertical blank was
 missed

_WaitForVerticalBlank() slept once, until shortly before the active
area's end, and then polled the line counter. Woken too late on a busy
system (decoding 1080p), it had missed the 0.67 ms blank and spun on a
core through the whole next frame, taking time from the decoder. It now
sleeps again for the next blank instead, and gives up after three frames
rather than two.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../drivers/graphics/meson_hdmi/meson_hdmi.cpp   | 16 +++++++---------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/add-ons/kernel/drivers/graphics/meson_hdmi/meson_hdmi.cpp b/src/add-ons/kernel/drivers/graphics/meson_hdmi/meson_hdmi.cpp
index fbaad0ad5a..28db4513af 100644
--- a/src/add-ons/kernel/drivers/graphics/meson_hdmi/meson_hdmi.cpp
+++ b/src/add-ons/kernel/drivers/graphics/meson_hdmi/meson_hdmi.cpp
@@ -1207,21 +1207,19 @@ MesonHdmi::_WaitForVerticalBlank()
 	bigtime_t lineTime = (bigtime_t)timing.h_total * 1000000
 		/ timing.pixel_clock;
 	bigtime_t deadline = system_time()
-		+ 2 * (timing.v_total * lineTime / 1000);
-	bool slept = false;
+		+ 3 * (timing.v_total * lineTime / 1000);
 	while (true) {
 		uint32 line = (_Vpu(ENCP_INFO_READ) >> 16) & 0x1fff;
 		if (line > activeEnd || line < blankEnd)
 			return;
-		bigtime_t now = system_time();
-		if (now >= deadline)
+		if (system_time() >= deadline)
 			return;
+		// Sleep until shortly before the active area ends, then poll. Woken
+		// too late (a busy system), the blank may be over: then sleep again
+		// for the next one rather than spin through a frame.
 		bigtime_t toBlank = (activeEnd + 1 - line) * lineTime / 1000;
-		if (!slept && toBlank > 300) {
-			// sleep until shortly before the active area ends
-			snooze(toBlank - 200);
-			slept = true;
-		}
+		if (toBlank > 400)
+			snooze(toBlank - 300);
 	}
 }
 
